  "contentHtml": "<div><!--IMG1--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/28/88016745.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120128141822im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/28/s88016745.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG1--><br><div>Та бүгдэд Дэлхийн хамгийн аймшигтай 50 аймшгийн киноны жагсаалтыг хүргэж байна. Бүх цаг үеийн кинонууд байгаа болохоор та бүхэн сонирхсон киногоо сэтгэгдэл дээр бичээрэй. Бид олон хүний саналаар кинонуудыг нь цувралаар оруулах болно гэдгээ амлаж байна. <br>Та аймшгийн кинонд дуртай юу хэрэв тийм бол энэ 50 кинонууд дунд таны үзээгүй ганц хоёр кино байж ч магадгүй. <br></div><br><div><p><!--IMG2--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/28/63836504.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120128141822im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/28/s63836504.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG2--></p><h3>50. Silent Night, Bloody Night (1974)</h3><p><!--IMG3--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/28/30912925.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120128141822im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/28/s30912925.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG3--></p><h3>49. Fire in the Sky (1993)</h3><p><!--IMG4--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/28/10225777.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120128141822im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/28/s10225777.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG4--></p><h3>48. When a Stranger Calls (1979)</h3><p><!--IMG5--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/28/54479530.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120128141822im_/htt